      "id": "claim_b3a8c5291be64cfc9cf073ba13da6e1e",
      "statement": "The AI search schema's SearchParameters carries is_decaf: bool | None (default None, 'Filter by decaf status'), letting natural-language queries like 'decaf espresso' translate into an is_decaf=true constraint that becomes a hard WHERE in the downstream search URL.",
