    {
      "id": "claim_60445bb198da4ec79c1caab5643c4d19",
      "statement": "The frontend models decaf as a tri-state boolean | undefined (undefined = no parameter, true = Decaf only, false = Caffeinated only), matching the API's bool | None, and SearchFilters.svelte renders it as a three-option All / Decaf only / Caffeinated only radio group that triggers onSearch() immediately on change.",
