    {
      "id": "claim_7d2ae63aa7f240f886b25429bbf37877",
      "statement": "The isDecaf state round-trips through the URL: the search store and route loaders write is_decaf=true / is_decaf=false only when defined, and parse it back with three-way logic ('true'->true, 'false'->false, absent->undefined), making the filter shareable and bookmarkable.",
