      "id": "claim_25f0dd0e97344cad910d7d443863b92a",
      "statement": "The discovery recommendations client (getDiscoveryRecommendations) supports an isDecafSwap option that requests recommendations with is_decaf set to the opposite of the source bean's is_decaf, falling back to is_decaf=true when the source bean's decaf status is undefined, so a decaf alternative is still offered.",
