    {
      "id": "claim_90588546e2954235ad212960efb1ff03",
      "statement": "The Beanconqueror share exporter maps is_decaf onto the external app's decaffeinated proto field, coercing it to a strict boolean (bool(bean.is_decaf)) so the downstream decoder never sees undefined — the boundary at which the lenient bool | None collapses back to strict bool.",
